    "detailed_description": "<h1>First release benefit</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;The Legend of the Mortal God&quot; will be launched at 15:00 on May 28th, and the five-fold top gift will be sent crazily.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 [Welfare I: First VIP Gift Package]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the redemption code: VIP666, VIP888, VIP99, and get the luxury reward now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Collection method: click the avatar \u2192 redemption code \u2192 enter the redemption)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf81 [Welfare II: Log in for 10 minutes and get SSR gods]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get &quot;Du Daji&quot; for free - limited-time exclusive SSR, log in and get it for free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc8e [Welfare 3: Break through the level and get 1000 draws!]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break through the level to win thousands of card drawing opportunities, and the divine general and equipment will be drawn to the soft hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f [Welfare IV: SP God General \u00b7 Bull Demon King for free!]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass level 380 and directly receive the SP top god general &quot;Pingtian Great Saint \u00b7 Niu Demon King&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc8c[Bonus 5: Get First Recharge on Character Creation]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Clear Stage 11, unlock the mail feature, and claim your First Recharge Voucher!</p></p><br><h1>Contact the official</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ:80085611</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ group: 864856116</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customer service email: <a href=\"mailto:mxzgamefrsjc@gmail.com\">mxzgamefrsjc@gmail.com</a></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Worldview Background | The Rise of Mortals in a Turbulent Era of Gods and Demons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543640/extras/3c875931893000053aeeffc6503f5e31.avif?t=1755152357\" width=610 height=274 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543640/extras/65cfe750fd8cc604174e689384a5b753.poster.avif?t=1755152357\" width=615 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543640/extras/65cfe750fd8cc604174e689384a5b753.webm?t=1755152357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Combat System | Strategic Combos Ignite the Battlefield</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543640/extras/29d9a7707ce7666b15e978786785dc9c.avif?t=1755152357\" width=610 height=274 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543640/extras/1442c6733746e0a9156cbb94631a1c99.poster.avif?t=1755152357\" width=615 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543640/extras/1442c6733746e0a9156cbb94631a1c99.webm?t=1755152357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Cultivation System | Freely Shape Your Exclusive Divine General</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543640/extras/94033d7b2af02a6e474cb3582cce2ce9.avif?t=1755152357\" width=610 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543640/extras/e5d09aceeba1f9dce01087bf143b06f0.poster.avif?t=1755152357\" width=615 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543640/extras/e5d09aceeba1f9dce01087bf143b06f0.webm?t=1755152357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art and Music | A New Realm of Dynamic Xianxia Aesthetics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543640/extras/714f23069394113b5148130864bf4023.avif?t=1755152357\" width=610 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543640/extras/caff67658808eef0b86ea1e70b257190.poster.avif?t=1755152357\" width=615 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543640/extras/caff67658808eef0b86ea1e70b257190.webm?t=1755152357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Continuous Update Plan | Co-building a Mythical Universe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summary: A living ecosystem where players determine the direction of world evolution. Quarterly expansion packs will unlock new realms such as the &quot;Dragon Palaces of the Four Seas&quot; and the &quot;Eighteen Layers of Hell,&quot; with server-wide player votes deciding the plot progression\u2014whether to assist the Ox Demon King in overthrowing the Heavenly Court or help Meng Po reconstruct the reincarnation system. The first-year plan includes 12 cultivatable mythological characters, 7 freely combinable formation systems, and a &quot;Zhu Xian Sword Formation&quot; siege battle supporting thousands of players on the same screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b Join Mortal Divine General Chronicles now and personally rewrite your own mythical chronicle \u203b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
