m_assets/steam/apps/3543640/extras/94033d7b2af02a6e474cb3582cce2ce9.avif?t=1755152357\" width=610 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543640/extras/e5d09aceeba1f9dce01087bf143b06f0.poster.avif?t=1755152357\" width=615 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543640/extras/e5d09aceeba1f9dce01087bf143b06f0.webm?t=1755152357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art and Music | A New Realm of Dynamic Xianxia Aesthetics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543640/extras/714f23069394113b5148130864bf4023.avif?t=1755152357\" width=610 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543640/extras/caff67658808eef0b86ea1e70b257190.poster.avif?t=1755152357\" width=615 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543640/extras/caff67658808eef0b86ea1e70b257190.webm?t=1755152357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Continuous Update Plan | Co-building a Mythical Universe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summary: A living ecosystem where players determine the direction of world evolution. Quarterly expansion packs will unlock new realms such as the &quot;Dragon Palaces of the Four Seas&quot; and the &quot;Eighteen Layers of Hell,&quot; with server-wide player votes deciding the plot progression\u2014whether to assist the Ox Demon King in overthrowing the Heavenly Court or help Meng Po reconstruct the reincarnation system. The first-year plan includes 12 cultivatable mythological characters, 7 freely combinable formation systems, and a &quot;Zhu Xian Sword Formation&quot; siege battle supporting thousands of players on the same screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b Join Mortal Divine General Chronicles now and personally rewrite your own mythical chronicle \u203b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
